  "notes": "Fluent Reader (Electron RSS reader) styled after Windows Fluent design: custom title bar with Windows minimize/maximize/close; sidebar #edebe9 vs content #faf9f8; selected nav item marked by a thin blue left bar. Article list in 'magazine' view: 200x160 square-cornered thumbnails on the left for items with images, text-only items full width; hairline separators; read articles fade to grey (#8a8886) rather than being removed; orange dot marks unread. Feed favicons are colored square monograms. Clicking an article opens a large centered overlay with prev/next arrows and toolbar (mark read, star, full-text, web view, more). View menu switches Card/List/Magazine/Compact layouts and filters All/Unread/Starred."
